{'slug':'swansea','name':'Swansea','title':'Online GCSE & A-Level Tutors Swansea | WJEC Maths Physics','desc':'One-to-one online tutoring in Swansea for WJEC GCSE Maths, Physics, Science, English and A-Level subjects. Covering Mumbles, Sketty, Uplands and beyond.','h1':'Online GCSE & A-Level tutors in Swansea','intro':'Personalised live online lessons for Swansea students in Maths, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, English and other GCSE and A-Level subjects.','neighbours':['Uplands','Sketty','Mumbles','Morriston','Gorseinon','Clydach','Killay','Pontarddulais','Brynmill','West Cross','Port Tennant','Bishopston'],'headline':'Focused Maths and Physics tutoring for Swansea learners','details':'''<p>Whether a student lives near Swansea city centre or in the wider suburban and coastal communities, tutoring can happen from home. This is helpful for sixth-formers needing A-Level Physics support, GCSE students revising Maths or families balancing lessons around school and other commitments.</p><p>We can discuss recurring one-to-one sessions or a shorter block of revision lessons. Tutor matching starts with a quick conversation about WJEC or the relevant UK exam board, the student’s year group and the most difficult topics.</p>''','special':'GCSE Maths, A-Level Physics and WJEC Science','faq':[('Are there online WJEC tutors for students in Swansea?','Yes. We can discuss online WJEC GCSE and A-Level tutoring for Swansea families and check suitable tutors.'),('Does South Wales Tutoring travel to Mumbles or Sketty?','We deliver live lessons online only. Students in Mumbles, Sketty and other Swansea areas can join from home.') ]},
{'slug':'newport','name':'Newport','title':'Online GCSE & A-Level Tutors Newport | Maths Physics WJEC','desc':'Find online GCSE and A-Level tutors in Newport for WJEC Maths, Physics, Chemistry, Biology and English. Covering Caerleon, Rogerstone and nearby areas.','h1':'Online GCSE & A-Level tutors in Newport','intro':'One-to-one online GCSE and A-Level tutoring for students throughout Newport, with support for WJEC Maths, Physics, Science and English.','neighbours':['Caerleon','Rogerstone','Bassaleg','Malpas','Bettws','Langstone','Pillgwenlly','St Julians','Ringland','Lliswerry','Duffryn','Marshfield'],'headline':'Subject-focused online tuition for Newport and eastern South Wales','details':'''<p>Families in Newport and neighbouring communities often need support that fits around school timetables and transport. Online tutoring removes the commute and makes it possible to prioritise the tutor’s subject expertise and communication style.</p><p>For GCSE learners, this may mean building numeracy before tackling algebra, learning to choose the right Physics equation or improving the clarity of longer Biology answers. For A-Level students, it may mean revisiting a difficult unit in depth.</p>''','special':'GCSE Maths foundations, Physics, Biology and A-Level support','faq':[('Can you help Newport students with WJEC GCSE revision?','Yes. We can discuss WJEC GCSE tutoring for Newport students, based on the student’s current specification and topics.'),('Do you cover Caerleon and Rogerstone?','Yes. Caerleon, Rogerstone and other parts of Newport are within our online service area.') ]},
