{'slug':'valleys','name':'The South Wales Valleys','title':'Online Tutors South Wales Valleys | RCT Caerphilly Merthyr','desc':'Online GCSE Maths, Physics, Science and English tutors for Rhondda Cynon Taf, Caerphilly, Merthyr Tydfil, Ebbw Vale and the South Wales Valleys.','h1':'Online tutors across the South Wales Valleys','intro':'One-to-one online GCSE and A-Level tutoring for Rhondda Cynon Taf, Caerphilly, Merthyr Tydfil, Blaenau Gwent and communities across the South Wales Valleys.','neighbours':['Pontypridd','Aberdare','Treorchy','Tonypandy','Llantrisant','Caerphilly','Blackwood','Ystrad Mynach','Merthyr Tydfil','Ebbw Vale','Tredegar','Hengoed'],'headline':'More choice of specialist tutors for Valleys families','details':'''<p>Students living in the South Wales Valleys should be able to access subject-specific support without a long journey. Remote lessons allow a family in Aberdare, Pontypridd, Caerphilly, Merthyr Tydfil or Ebbw Vale to enquire about the same wider tutor network.</p><p>This is particularly useful when a learner needs help in a specific topic such as A-Level Physics, GCSE Maths and Numeracy or WJEC exam technique. We check the qualification and preferred lesson times before recommending a suitable tutor.</p>''','special':'WJEC GCSE Maths and Numeracy, separate sciences, A-Level Maths and Physics','faq':[('Do you provide online tutoring in Rhondda Cynon Taf?','Yes. We support online tutoring enquiries from Pontypridd, Aberdare, Treorchy, Tonypandy, Llantrisant and elsewhere in Rhondda Cynon Taf.'),('Can students in Caerphilly and Merthyr Tydfil book online tutors?','Yes. Caerphilly and Merthyr Tydfil are included within our online South Wales tutoring service areas.') ]},
