privacy=page_hero('Privacy policy','How South Wales Tutoring handles the personal information you give us through our website and tutoring enquiries.', [('Privacy policy','privacy-policy.html')], 'Your information')+'''
<section class="section-pad"><div class="container"><article class="prose mx-auto"><p><strong>Last updated: 11 November 2026.</strong> South Wales Tutoring operates as part of North Wales Tutoring Group. This policy describes our handling of personal information through this website. It should be read alongside the group’s wider service terms where applicable.</p>
<h2>1. Who to contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests to access, update or delete information, email <a href="mailto:southwales@nwttutoring.com">southwales@nwttutoring.com</a>. South Wales Tutoring is part of <a href="https://nwttutoring.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">North Wales Tutoring Group</a>.</p>
<h2>2. Information collected</h2><p>When you enquire, we may receive your name, email address, phone number, subject, school stage, general area, message, and any information you choose to include in it. We may also receive ordinary technical data when you use the website and form services.</p>
<h2>3. Why we use it</h2><p>We use your details to respond to an enquiry, find an appropriate tutor, arrange requested lessons, manage our tutoring relationship and meet applicable legal responsibilities. We do not require consent to marketing in order to submit an enquiry.</p>
<h2>4. Our lawful bases</h2><p>Depending on the activity, processing may rely on taking steps before entering a tutoring contract, performing a contract, complying with a legal obligation, or our legitimate interests in answering enquiries and operating the service. We assess the appropriate lawful basis for the activity.</p>
<h2>5. Form provider and other services</h2><p>Our enquiry forms are submitted using <a href="https://web3forms.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Web3Forms</a>, a third-party email form processor. Information submitted may be processed outside the UK, including in the United States. We also use Bootstrap and fonts from external providers for site presentation. Do not submit sensitive personal data through the initial enquiry form.</p>
<h2>6. Sharing details</h2><p>Where necessary to respond or arrange requested tutoring, appropriate details may be shared with relevant staff, contractors or tutors in the wider group. We do not sell personal data. We may disclose information if legally required.</p>
<h2>7. Retention and security</h2><p>We aim to retain enquiry information only as long as necessary for the relevant purpose, subject to legal, accounting or safeguarding obligations. Security measures and service providers are reviewed in line with our operational responsibilities.</p>
<h2>8. Your rights</h2><p>Subject to applicable law, you can request access, correction, erasure, restriction, or object to certain processing. You can also raise a concern with the UK Information Commissioner’s Office at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>
<h2>9. Cookies and storage</h2><p>Our cookie banner remembers your choice in local storage. No optional advertising or analytics tracking script is installed in this website release. See our <a href="{B}cookie-policy.html">cookie policy</a> for details.</p>
<h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2><p>We may update this notice as our services or providers change. The update date at the top of the page will reflect revisions.</p><div class="resource-inline"><p><strong>Before launch:</strong> the organisation should review this notice against its actual internal retention periods, lawful-basis records and tutoring privacy procedures.</p></div></article></div></section>'''
render('privacy-policy.html','Privacy Policy | South Wales Tutoring','How South Wales Tutoring collects, uses and protects information sent through online tutoring enquiry forms, including third-party Web3Forms processing.',privacy,crumbs=[('Privacy policy','privacy-policy.html')])

cookies=page_hero('Cookie policy','Understand the website’s cookie and local storage use, including how to change your preferences.', [('Cookie policy','cookie-policy.html')], 'Privacy and choices')+'''
<section class="section-pad"><div class="container"><article class="prose mx-auto"><p><strong>Last updated: 11 November 2026.</strong> This notice applies to the South Wales Tutoring website.</p>
<h2>Essential website storage</h2><p>We store a simple preference called <code>swt-cookie-consent-v1</code> in your browser's local storage so the cookie banner does not appear on every visit. The value is either <code>accepted</code> or <code>declined</code>. It does not contain your identity.</p>
<h2>Analytics and advertising</h2><p>In this website release, we have not installed optional Google Analytics, Meta Pixel or advertising cookies. Choosing Accept or Decline currently changes only your saved preference; no optional tracking is enabled by either choice.</p>
<h2>Third-party resources</h2><p>Bootstrap, Bootstrap Icons and the Manrope font may be loaded from their CDN or font-provider domains. Their respective providers may receive normal technical request data. The enquiry form connects to Web3Forms only when you submit the form.</p>
<h2>How to change your choice</h2><p>Use the <button type="button" class="btn-outline-brand" onclick="window.SWTshowCookiePreferences?.()">Open cookie settings</button> control or the Cookie settings link in the footer. You can also clear this site's local storage in your browser settings.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2><p>If you have privacy questions, email <a href="mailto:southwales@nwttutoring.com">southwales@nwttutoring.com</a> or see the <a href="{B}privacy-policy.html">privacy policy</a>.</p></article></div></section>'''
render('cookie-policy.html','Cookie Policy | South Wales Tutoring','See how South Wales Tutoring uses essential browser storage, third-party website resources and cookie preferences. Optional analytics are not enabled.',cookies,crumbs=[('Cookie policy','cookie-policy.html')])

